<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-about-secondary py-16 text-on-about-secondary sm:py-20 lg:py-24"
  aria-labelledby="mision-vision-title"
>
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_rgba(24,24,27,0.06),_transparent_65%)]"
  >
  </div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1280px] px-6 lg:px-8">
    <header class="max-w-3xl">
      <p
        class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-on-about-secondary/60 uppercase"
      >
        Propósito — Hoy y mañana
      </p>
      <h2
        id="mision-vision-title"
        class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Misión y Visión
      </h2>
      <p
        class="mt-3 max-w-2xl font-body text-sm leading-6 text-on-about-secondary/65"
      >
        Dos frases que guían cada decisión: lo que hacemos hoy y lo que queremos
        llegar a ser.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start lg:gap-8">
      <article
        aria-labelledby="mision-title"
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-on-about-secondary/10 bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(24,24,27,0.08)] sm:p-9"
      >
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-4 -left-2 font-display text-[9rem] leading-none font-black tracking-tighter text-on-about-secondary/[0.06] select-none"
          >“</span
        >
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-about-primary text-[11px] leading-none font-bold text-on-about-primary"
              aria-hidden="true">M</span
            >
            <p
              class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-on-about-secondary/60 uppercase"
            >
              Misión — Hoy
            </p>
          </div>
          <h3 id="mision-title" class="sr-only">Misión</h3>
          <blockquote class="mt-5">
            <p
              class="font-display text-[22px] leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-on-about-secondary sm:text-[26px]"
            >
              “Cuidar personas, no solo atender pacientes.”
            </p>
          </blockquote>
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="my-5 h-px w-full bg-on-about-secondary/10"
          >
          </div>
          <p class="font-body text-[17px] leading-7 text-on-about-secondary/75">
            En Kenko EPS convertimos cada servicio de salud en una oportunidad
            para escuchar, acompañar y cuidar, ofreciendo atención de calidad
            con
            <em class="font-medium text-on-about-secondary not-italic"
              > tecnología, empatía y compromiso</em
            >.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article
        aria-labelledby="vision-title"
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-on-about-secondary/10 bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(24,24,27,0.08)] sm:p-9 lg:mt-8"
      >
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-4 -left-2 font-display text-[9rem] leading-none font-black tracking-tighter text-on-about-secondary/[0.06] select-none"
          >“</span
        >
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-about-primary text-[11px] leading-none font-bold text-on-about-primary"
              aria-hidden="true">V</span
            >
            <p
              class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-on-about-secondary/60 uppercase"
            >
              Visión — Mañana
            </p>
          </div>
          <h3 id="vision-title" class="sr-only">Visión</h3>
          <blockquote class="mt-5">
            <p
              class="font-display text-[22px] leading-[1.25] font-semibold tracking-tight text-on-about-secondary sm:text-[26px]"
            >
              “Ser la EPS que todos quisieran tener cuando más necesitan
              sentirse acompañados.”
            </p>
          </blockquote>
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="my-5 h-px w-full bg-on-about-secondary/10"
          >
          </div>
          <p class="font-body text-[17px] leading-7 text-on-about-secondary/75">
            Kenko EPS busca convertirse en un referente de salud
            <em class="font-medium text-on-about-secondary not-italic"
              > humana e innovadora</em
            >, donde cada afiliado encuentre no solo atención, sino también
            <em class="font-medium text-on-about-secondary not-italic"
              > confianza y bienestar</em
            >.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
